<title>USA: Shanghai Petrochemical first half net down.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Petrochemical first half net down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Petrochemical Co Ltd said Tuesday its first half profits dropped 34.29 percent to 794 million Yuan, or 0.121 Yuan per share.</p>
<p>In a statement released in New York, the company said revenues increased 2.65 percent to 5.91 billion Yuan.</p>
<p>The statement did not include actual year ago results.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said these would be included in tabular material being released later.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
